<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Worldwide 1996 net up 50.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Worldwide 1996 net up 50.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 47.72   vs	 31.76</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	30.0    vs	 20.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  145.87   vs	119.99</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   80.39   vs	 55.23</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 7.50   vs   less 6.91</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    -     vs	   -</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	7.0    vs	  5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Worldwide Holdings Bhd is a property and hotel concern and also has interests in power generation.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
